      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We highly recommend this local Sunshine Coast electrical company for solar system installation. They explained every process thoroughly and were honest with their assessment of our current & future needs in their system recommendation.  There was no “sales pressure” and all our questions were answered promptly whilst we considered the quote. They kept us informed on the turnaround timing once we placed our order which ended up quicker than expected.  They handled the application to the grid supplier which was seamless.  The installation team were friendly, reliable, professional and we cannot fault their workmanship on-site.  They provided both of us with a complete handover of the system and have been helpful with questions post-installation.  We are so happy with the team at Flux Electrical we will be recommending them to family & friends for any solar or domestic electrical projects.",
