      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "After many quotes from solar specialist, we decided upon Matt as he spoke 'to' us rather than 'at' us. He used simple language and did not rush us. He sat and explained various options to us before tailoring a solar system to the needs of our property. We had a house with some awkward wiring issues and a fuse box that was dated. Matt provided us with advise and sensible suggestions and certainly made things safer and bought a lot of electrical issues up to date. Matt does not sub contract and is involved with all the work which is a refreshing rarity these days. Thank you Matt.",
