      "review_description": "Matt from Flux was very knowledgeable and informative re the solar and best inverter etc to suit us, He and  his offsider turned up on  the installation date right on time at 8am  and did not leave til the job ( 24 panels in all) was complete at 6.30pm that night.  They kept us informed re cabling and all other aspects and came back next day to hook the inverter in  into our wifi and show us how to use it. We are generating the expected KWH and couldn't be happier with Matt and his excellent service. He even did a few extra things for free ie cleanout our rats nest infested meter box!! Highly recommend him to anyone on the Sunshine Coast contemplating solar.  thanks  Matt!Cam & Wendy",
